  "StockRole": "Powered Infantry",
  "YangsThoughts": "Despite the standard Elemental's all-around utility, Clan Hell's Horses sought to enhance their Elementals mobility. The result of their work, Elemental II, discards Jump Jets and SRM pack in favor of battle armor myomer booster. The design didn't gain popularity and saw no interest from other clans, and Elemental II remains in limited service in Hell's Horses garrisons.",
